Package: testops-gate-node
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://testopscenter.com
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), openvpn (>= 2.5), openssl, iproute2, ca-certificates, systemd
Description: TestOps Gate node - join a server to a TestOps Gate VPN
 Joins this server to a TestOps Gate VPN with the one-time command that
 `testops-gate node add NAME` prints on the VPN server. The private key is
 made on this server; the connection runs as openvpn-client@testops-gate.
